#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
MiniCut Patch 30: MEDIA FILTER GALLERY + SOUND FILTER HELPERS   (needs patch 29)
================================================================================
Media filters (Effects tab)
 * the gallery has a search box, a category list (with counts) and three effects per row; pictures are made only for the
   tiles that are on screen (fast also with many effects) and kept for next time
 * every effect layer has "Spill outside the media": off = the effect is cut at the edges of the media, on = it may go beyond
   (blur, glow ...). The picture is made larger with an empty border while such a layer is on.
 * sliders show what they do: a hue slider shows the colours, an opacity / amount slider fades from see-through to the colour
   of the effect (and follows the colour you pick); brightness / saturation / vignette / glow ... have their own tracks.
   New effects get this automatically from the names of their parameters.
Sound filter (Audio tab)
 * every filter explains what it does and how to use it (also in the Add filter list)
 * "Fit length to filter": when echo / reverb make the sound last longer than the clip, a button makes the clip as long as the
   filtered sound so the end is not cut off (the tail is also allowed when you drag the end of the clip)
 * Auto adjust for Denoise, Noise gate and Hiss remover: a window draws the loudness of the clip; drag the yellow line to
   where the noise is, press Apply and the filter is set to fit. Denoise has a new "Noise level" value (-90 = automatic).

    python apply_30_filter_ui.py            install
    python apply_30_filter_ui.py --check    preview only
    python apply_30_filter_ui.py --revert   undo last install
    python apply_30_filter_ui.py --force    install over local edits
"""
import datetime, hashlib, json, os, py_compile, shutil, subprocess, sys

